            <ArticleTitle>Direct alkylheteroarylation of alkenes via photoredox mediated C-H functionalization.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>12946-12949</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1039/c7cc06484e</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The direct alkylheteroarylation of alkenes with cyclic and acyclic ethers via distal heteroaryl ipso-migration has been accomplished through the design of a photoredox-mediated C-H functionalization pathway. The use of inexpensive ethers as radical precursors combined with a straightforward method makes this a practical approach.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
